,"r":"dish/latiya-dessert","n":"Latiya (dessert)","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from American cuisine","dot":"#94bd5c","intro":[["Latiya (Lantiyas in CNMI dialect) is a Chamorro dessert from Guam made from sponge cake, vanilla custard, and cinnamon. In Saipan and the other Mariana Islands, it is called lantiya. First, the sponge cake is baked, sliced, and then covered with a custard. The sponge cake can be one of any variety, such as pound cake, carrot cake, or Chamorro cake. The custard may or may not contain eggs, and can also be poured in between the layers of cake. At the end, the cake is topped with cinnamon."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-latiya-dessert"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Latiya_(dessert)"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["American cuisine","cuisine/american-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":2,"links":[["Castella","ingredient/castella"],["Cinnamon","ingredient/cinnamon"]]},{"h":"More from American cuisine","links":[["5-8 Club","dish/5-8-club"],["Altabira City Tavern","dish/altabira-city-tavern"],["Angel food cake","dish/angel-food-cake"],["Applebee's","dish/applebee-s"],["Arby's","dish/arby-s"],["Arnold's Bar and Grill","dish/arnold-s-bar-and-grill"],["Banana bread","dish/banana-bread"],["Banana pudding","dish/banana-pudding"],["Barbecue sauce","dish/barbecue-sauce"],["Be Our Guest Restaurant","dish/be-our-guest-restaurant"],["Beer cake","dish/beer-cake"],["Ben's Chili Bowl","dish/ben-s-chili-bowl"],["Benjy's","dish/benjy-s"],["Besaw's","dish/besaw-s"],["Better than sex cake","dish/better-than-sex-cake"],["Blackhawk (restaurant)","dish/blackhawk-restaurant"],["Blini","dish/blini"],["Blooming onion","dish/blooming-onion"],["Bobcat Bite","dish/bobcat-bite"],["Boiling Springs Tavern","dish/boiling-springs-tavern"],["Brix Tavern","dish/brix-tavern"],["Brown Betty (dessert)","dish/brown-betty-dessert"],["Brown Derby","dish/brown-derby"],["Brunswick stew","d